    "body": "That looks like a bug in Firefox with their path drawing methods. Using `drawImage` instead, they act as expected: https://jsfiddle.net/34xf27uh/\n\nPs: If you open an issue, it's caused by https://bugzil.la/1911231 With a skewed matrix, even `fillRect` produces the correct result.",
