    "updated_at": "2025-08-20T06:46:04Z",
    "body": "I opened https://bugzil.la/1984014\n\nRegarding the specs changes, I'm not sure what could be clarified here. There is only one destination and one source drawing, so it's not clear what could be isolated from what.  \n\nAs for the tests, I'm not sure either which one you were referring to, but maybe it's [2d.composite.clip.copy](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/canvas/element/compositing/2d.composite.clip.copy.html)? In that case, the test is correct, since the compositing is to be done \"within the [clipping region](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#clipping-region)\" as per your quote. ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
